WEBVTT

00:00:00.670 --> 00:00:04.720
The plan was to go out and stop 
the war as fast as they could,

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.100
but the Ulga Sorority's Ulbrion 
assassins got in the way.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:15.070
It was Erec's Incognito 
troupe who saved the day.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:21.410
After becoming temporary allies, 
they make haste for Sarisariñama.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.000
And right when it seemed 
that Kon's strange tactic

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.070
had actually stopped the war,

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:31.260
the Ulga Sorority's ultimate 
weapon awoke.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:47.150
When Nagai-san does the narration,

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:47.150
this actually feels like a decent series (lol).

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:53.070
And with that, it's finally the last episode!!

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:53.070
Will peace be restored in the Mira world?

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:05.440
Achoo!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.280
Hey, what the hell is that?

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:24.020
What is going on here?

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:28.350
That's Taulepton's trump 
card, his secret weapon.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:30.020
Forezo...

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:32.010
What the hell is that thing?

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:33.240
Figure it out.

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:36.060
It's the Ulga Sorority's ultimate weapon.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.230
I never would've thought they 
could produce something so huge.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:41.540
Just goes to show they're 
not a respectable religion.

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:43.150
So what are you going to do?

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:44.650
Anybody got a plan?

00:01:44.650 --> 00:01:47.320
I heard that the archbishop 
planned to exterminate

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:50.040
both the empire's and Jugglaburk's 
troops in one swoop.

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:54.810
I guess none of us imagined they 
had prepared something this huge.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:57.800
It's beyond anyone's expectations.

00:01:58.250 --> 00:01:59.340
Hey, Mysty.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:01.660
Can't you use your powers 
and do something?

00:02:01.660 --> 00:02:02.260
Nope.

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.570
I thought you were an Ixion!

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:05.980
There must be some kind 
of secret technology,

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:07.740
or some Alma Mecha you could use!

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:09.400
You shouldn't be so stingy!

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.170
I'm sorry, but I can't.

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:13.400
Do you wanna save the world or not?!

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.280
Go on, Forezo!

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.580
Listen up, you pieces of garbage.

00:02:18.580 --> 00:02:21.780
Get ready for total world domination!

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.250
Either way, I can't just stand back and watch.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.920
To arms!

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:37.130
Yes, sir!

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.540
Now hang on!

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:41.430
You really think you can 
take that thing on?

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:44.180
You want me to sit around and 
watch with my thumb up my butt?

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.890
Well, will you at least consider 
the size of that thing?

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.890
If you think of him as human-sized,

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:51.190
that makes us smaller than fleas!

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:53.020
Even if he gives his best,

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.830
the most a flea can do 
is make a human itch!

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:58.220
In other words, the chances 
of us taking him down

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:02.010
are about the same as the chances 
of me going out with Mayuyu!

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:04.620
Why can't you see that? You idiot!

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.200
DT, you're forgetting something.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:11.120
We're not just ordinary humans.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:14.710
We're Hyperion, and just the 
right beings for a miracle.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.040
Don't you agree?

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:17.500
Truer words could not 
be spoken, Erec-sama.

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.520
Pu-lease!

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:19.390
I mean, really?!

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:20.600
You're encouraging him?

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.630
You should be doing the opposite!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:24.930
This truly is a 
once-in-a-lifetime gamble.

00:03:25.650 --> 00:03:28.640
My fate is aligned with Erec-sama's.

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:29.660
Then let's go!

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:32.480
The fate of the world 
lies in our hands!

00:03:32.480 --> 00:03:33.540
Wait.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:35.150
You can try, but you can't stop us.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:35.900
That's not it.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:39.460
If you're going to try to take him 
down, aim for his little toe.

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:41.340
That's what I'd aim for.

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:45.090
Consider the size of it, huh?

00:03:45.470 --> 00:03:46.280
All right.

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.530
Prepare to attack!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:51.260
Focus your attacks on his 
right foot's little toe!

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:52.320
Yes, sir!

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.630
Us, too!

00:03:58.630 --> 00:03:59.360
Let's go!

00:03:59.360 --> 00:03:59.880
Yeah!

00:04:07.300 --> 00:04:10.970
Post-Show Cabaret Girl 
Makeout Session Thunder!

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:12.450
What the hell is that 
attack supposed to be?

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:14.100
Isn't it a little early to ad-lib?

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:19.050
When I Get Drunk I Talk 
Like a Girl Thunder!

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:21.630
Hey, you're just saying lines now,

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:23.490
those aren't even special 
move names anymore!

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:29.410
Pepipopiplague, Periperiperi, Come Out Alma,

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:30.700
Or Something Like That Thunder!

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:33.490
Hey, the last time you said 
that spell, it was different!

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.330
And what's with the thunder?

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.590
Go, Calibre!

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.070
No special name for this move!

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.800
Hurt Me More!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:41.550
Thunder!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.840
Take It Or Leave It!

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.840
Kitty Meow Meow!

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.090
Thunder!

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:46.840
Stop saying them together!

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:47.800
This is supposed to be a big show!

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:51.010
You think anything goes as long 
as you say thunder, don't you?!

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.760
Take that!

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:03.470
No way.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:04.700
He's not hurt at all?!

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:05.960
So that's it, huh?

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:07.570
He can't even feel pain?

00:05:11.630 --> 00:05:12.810
You can't give up!

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:17.080
If we Hyperions give up, 
the world is done for!

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:18.430
Erec-sama!

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:27.240
Um, so he's kind of looking at us.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:28.730
This is not good.

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:30.860
Hey, what do you think you're doing?!

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.440
It's wicked pissed!

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.990
I said, don't give up.

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:38.830
Forezo!

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:34.340
Hey, Forezo!

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:41.320
Who gave you permission to 
grow so friggin' big?!

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:45.960
Fore?

00:06:46.140 --> 00:06:47.010
What?

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.840
He stopped moving!

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:51.520
You know what you are?

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.700
A huge nuisance! Your very 
existence is a huge nuisance!

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:58.850
I mean, you take one step and

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.400
it's like you screw up 
the whole neighborhood!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.260
What do you have to say for yourself?

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:06.420
You think going "foooo" 
is going to cut it?

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.200
What is that supposed to mean anyway?

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:09.860
Because your name is Forezo, 
you have to go "foooo"?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:10.960
Is that a joke?

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:13.650
Do you have that little 
confidence in yourself?

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:16.200
Or do you think you can just do what 
you want, because you're big?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.370
Oh, got you, huh?

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:20.480
Then why don't you try using 
real words for a change?!

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:22.830
Foooo...

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:27.380
Don't try to use freaking "fooo" 
to express every emotion!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.570
Gimme a break!

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:32.240
You're not some character from Ikue!

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:35.710
The least you could do is 
twist the Merumeru character!

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:37.220
You moron!

00:07:38.870 --> 00:07:40.470
What?

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:43.450
When the going gets 
tough, you get quiet?

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.640
You think I'm going to let 
you get away with that?

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.780
You think if you keep quiet we'll 
just let you do whatever you please?

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.740
Is that what you really think?

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:54.230
Now listen up, you turd.

00:07:54.230 --> 00:07:57.320
You think that's enough, to speak 
only when you're spoken to?

00:07:57.320 --> 00:07:59.500
Can you even think for yourself?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.550
You going to let the others do the 
talking and the thinking for you?

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:06.100
So what, if somebody told 
you to die, you'd do it?!

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:08.670
You'd just die right then?! Huh?!

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:11.520
What do you have to say 
about that, Fore-chan?

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:13.570
Huh? You telling me that 
you're all right with that?

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.760
You're really telling me that 
you're all right with that?!

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:23.060
Um, thank you.

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.770
And my apologies.

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:27.400
He can actually talk?!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:30.300
I see, you say you're sorry.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:33.480
So you're actually repenting.

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:39.410
Yes, I am.

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:46.130
If sorry was enough, we wouldn't 
need store detectives!

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:55.180
Uh, well. Well then, what can I do?

00:08:57.550 --> 00:08:59.960
Forezo, onward!

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:11.160
Who would've thought he could

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:13.400
actually subdue even the 
Ultimate Weapon just by talking?

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.860
If we look at the results alone,

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:18.330
does that make him the 
hero who saved our world?

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:21.500
Well, that's our Kon for ya.

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:23.780
Talking was always his 
only real strength.

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.940
The reason I chose Kon

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:28.750
was because of his powerful 
Hyperion abilities.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.130
How long have you been there?

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:31.770
I just got here.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.140
I see.

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:34.440
Shall I continue?

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:35.940
Of course!

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.100
Well then...

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:41.970
But he didn't actually use 
those abilities even once.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:46.150
After he came to this world,

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:51.890
I was hoping that he would 
become the ultimate warrior.

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:53.780
Just like he did in that game.

00:09:54.310 --> 00:09:57.320
However, he betrayed my expectations

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:01.200
and didn't use his Hyperion powers, 
thus keeping his hands clean.

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:04.990
Stop, stop!

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:06.540
I'm scared, Naboton is so scared!

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:11.100
Kon used the sophism so 
common in today's youth,

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.750
and argued with this world.

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:19.050
Thus he proved that the power 
of words is even mightier

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:22.050
than the power of the Hyperion.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:29.810
Who are you again?

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.130
I'm your Minister of State!

00:10:32.130 --> 00:10:37.750
So yes, the end result is 
that he did save our world.

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:42.460
So what you're trying to say is that 
this was all unexpected, even for you.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.940
Well, that's Kon for you, huh?

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:48.390
Did we expect anything else?

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:51.030
He's the man who exceeded even 
the Ixion's expectations!

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:53.930
One thing's sure, he's one of a kind!

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:55.550
Quite right!

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:03.650
Hey!

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:08.350
I got the senile geezer and Nosehair!

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.870
On that day, after the battle,

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:22.410
a peace treaty was signed 
by the empire and

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.980
Jugglaburk's anti-empire forces.

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:31.730
Your Excellency!

00:11:31.730 --> 00:11:32.520
This way please!

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:34.610
What is the meaning of this?

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:36.930
How could Forezo be 
taken by the enemy?!

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:39.590
Your Excellency, the technology 
is still in our hands.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.620
We can still create a second Forezo.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:43.500
You're right.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:48.090
We'll let them have this round, 
but our ambitions will most definitely—

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:48.680
Your Excellency!

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:53.980
Do you really think 
you can achieve them?

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:57.570
What are you doing here, Erecpyle?

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:58.840
Your Excellency!

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:00.960
No, Taulepton.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:04.700
I am fully aware that you are the 
true instigator behind all this!

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:05.940
What are you talking about?

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:07.140
I...

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:07.140
Silence!

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:09.170
All of your ambitions 
have come to light!

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:11.530
But your days of planning evil 
deeds have come to an end!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:13.580
Get him!

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:17.590
Sorry about that, scumbag.

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:20.880
Prepare yourself!

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:35.990
The crisis was averted.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:39.900
After that, the king cited 
health reasons and abdicated,

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.780
and a new king was crowned.

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:46.240
Nabokov's perversions came to light, 
and after losing his standing

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.740
he transferred his powers to his nephew.

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:53.250
Archbishop Taulepton was 
tried and lost everything.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:57.540
As for the Ulbrion, they were 
set to hard physical labor.

00:12:57.540 --> 00:13:02.970
Following Kon's suggestion, 
Forezo moved to an uninhabited island.

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:06.550
And then...

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:14.060
Do we really need to do this?

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:15.420
Of course!

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:18.310
This score has to be settled!

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:19.830
I already told you.

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:21.820
We can just be even-steven.

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:24.240
In fact, I'd be happy if 
you just forget about it.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.490
You think I can do that?

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.760
I can't move forward 
until we have our fight!

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:30.910
Not even a single step!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:35.080
A famous general once said that 
trans people do not need to fight...

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.460
Enough speeches!

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:37.790
Get ready!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.650
All right, DT!

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:46.880
We're going to settle 
this once and for all!

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:50.210
Let's protect Kon!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:51.350
Roger!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.350
Sorry, Princess.

00:13:58.330 --> 00:13:59.580
We won't let you go!

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:01.230
Stop stealing our lines!

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:07.740
Oh no!

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.200
They can't stop him!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.950
Desperate times call for 
desperate measures!

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:13.920
It's the Ultimate Final Pet Weapon! Go!

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:16.660
I'm betting everything on you!

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.460
No!

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:19.420
Not going to happen!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.000
DT!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.670
ED!

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.930
This is for my son!

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:35.570
Prepare yourself!

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:48.070
Erec, wait!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.480
Sis!

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:57.540
When you say "my son," 
do you mean that one?

00:14:58.770 --> 00:15:03.020
Speaking of, you're not married 
yet, right, Erec-sama?

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:04.680
So what, a love child?

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:07.160
How dare you keep something 
like that from me?

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:08.010
Shut up!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.090
This has nothing to do with...

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:09.720
You're wrong!

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:10.430
I...

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.850
By wrong, which one are 
you saying is wrong?

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.430
By son, do you mean...

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:21.150
Yes.

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.440
I mean that son.

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:24.690
Is it true?

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:26.540
Erec-sama has...

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.290
Erec-sama's son...

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.280
...has no balls?!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:33.350
I knew it!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:37.540
Then you and Kon have 
nothing to fight about!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.300
Don't be ridiculous!

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:42.290
It's his fault that I lost Emilia!

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:43.740
It's okay.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:46.670
You can get those balls back.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:47.550
What are you saying?

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:53.510
I've decided to stop being both sides.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:59.220
I will gift you my balls.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:02.120
That's impossible!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.370
Once balls have been lost, 
they can't be attached again.

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:05.130
Yes, they can.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.320
Ixion technology is way too convenient!

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:15.640
What's this development 
supposed to mean?

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:18.870
We can't even get in a word in here.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:19.830
Sis...

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:23.170
Should we do it right now, Marian?

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.400
Of course.

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:25.780
Is that okay, Erecpyle?

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:27.590
Yeah.

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:32.940
Let's begin.

00:17:14.900 --> 00:17:16.110
So now I...

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:18.010
That feels so smooth!

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:20.760
They're both... They're both there.

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:27.020
This is the secret way of the Ixion!

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:29.020
It's a miracle!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:31.240
Or just lucky happenstance.

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:33.400
Congratulations, Erecpyle.

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:36.130
I am in your debt.

00:17:38.630 --> 00:17:39.740
Emilia!

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:41.250
My son...

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:46.370
My balls are back!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:50.900
So now what?

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:53.260
Looks like you've 
wracked up a new debt.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.130
Erec-sama...

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.180
How heart-wrenching...

00:17:56.770 --> 00:18:00.190
We no longer have a reason 
to fight, isn't that right?

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:04.890
You should be grateful towards her.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:09.550
She saved your life, DT.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:13.480
Will you please stop calling me that?

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:19.450
Because it looks like now I'm 
going to lose my DT.

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:28.950
So let's get to it, Mysty!

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:29.900
Now just a...

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.880
I'm going through a new door!

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:31.600
Hey...

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:34.220
I want you to take my DT.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:35.330
I can't.

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:36.790
Yes, you can!

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:38.810
What are you saying?

00:18:38.810 --> 00:18:43.020
You said if I saved the 
world, you'd take my DT.

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:45.890
What I mean is that I can't do it here.

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:47.240
Then where?

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.600
Where can you do it?

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.400
Where will you take it, then?

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:53.390
I'll go to your room later.

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:55.400
Is that all right?

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:56.860
You swear?

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:57.980
Of course.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:00.660
I won't forgive you if you lie to me.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:01.810
Don't worry.

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:03.380
I'm going to keep my promise.

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.650
Believe me.

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:05.900
Okay.

00:19:05.900 --> 00:19:06.910
But you promised!

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.630
Sorry, Kon-kun.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.000
Ixion aren't capable of that.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:13.990
All right, everyone!

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:16.920
I know this is sudden, but I'm 
going back to my own world.

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:20.050
Thanks for everything.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.220
Hey, Mysty!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.260
What was that?!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:26.770
You're just going to 
make him disappear?

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:28.980
At least let us say goodbye!

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:30.770
S-Sorry.

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:36.210
Huh?

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:37.380
Hey, Kon!

00:19:38.980 --> 00:19:40.030
Princess...

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:48.660
Princess!

00:19:50.940 --> 00:19:52.210
What the hell are you doing?

00:19:55.490 --> 00:19:57.700
Shut up, slave!

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.470
Closing this chapter with a punch!

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:06.680
Princess...

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:14.250
Let's shake hands again in ten years.

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:20.420
You idiot.

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.330
How can you say something like that?

00:20:39.120 --> 00:20:40.940
You better grow up to be a good woman.

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:41.920
You one-time divorcée.

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:48.600
Hey, old man!

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:49.880
Sis!

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:50.600
Pet!

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.700
I'm counting on you all 
to look after her.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:53.630
Yeah.

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:54.570
You can count on us.

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:56.760
And you look out for you.

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:59.360
Erec, and everybody there.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:01.860
Take care of this world!

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:04.280
I will.

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:37.600
Huh?

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:49.030
You're telling me I just fell 
over in my chair and passed out?

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:51.760
Damn, that was a long dream.

00:21:51.760 --> 00:21:53.380
Felt like a good half a year went by.

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:56.210
Flora: I'm sorry, Kon-kun.

00:21:57.050 --> 00:22:01.080
I know you were pretending 
to be someone else.

00:22:18.760 --> 00:22:19.860
Ouch!

00:24:20.530 --> 00:24:24.400
Ten years later, Kon still 
hadn't gotten rid of his DT.

00:24:24.400 --> 00:24:28.530
And once again, he was summoned 
to the Mira world for a crisis.

00:24:28.530 --> 00:24:30.940
"Ixion Saga DT Second."

00:24:30.940 --> 00:24:33.120
Can you survive?

00:24:33.120 --> 00:24:34.510
No, I won't do that!

00:24:33.390 --> 00:24:34.910
At this point, a second 
season is not planned.

00:24:34.910 --> 00:24:39.910
Ah, that was fun.

00:24:34.910 --> 00:24:39.910
Should we have tried for another six months?

00:24:39.910 --> 00:24:45.580
So...

00:24:39.910 --> 00:24:45.580
'Till some other time!
